re_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.poster.avif?t=1753885444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.webm?t=1753885444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.mp4?t=1753885444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>World Exploration</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore desolate deserts with flying sand and stones, ice-bound tundras, and mysterious ruins to obtain region-specific resources. Open wild treasure chests to win rare materials and equipment, and unlock cryo-pods to expand your workforce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/11863bd97b596a3f463bebb5653b03da.poster.avif?t=1753885444\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/11863bd97b596a3f463bebb5653b03da.webm?t=1753885444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/11863bd97b596a3f463bebb5653b03da.mp4?t=1753885444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All English text in the game was translated with the help of AI, so some lines might sound a little funky here and there. If you catch anything that makes you go \u201cwait, what?\u201d, feel free to swing by our Discord and let us know \u2014 your help might just save us from sounding like robots pretending to be human!</strong></p>",
